	(text "U3 is MCP73832 (open-drain STAT), not MCP73831.\nR3 = 2k: nominal 500mA charge. Q6 opens PROG return during actuation.\nJ2: protected 1S Li-ion pack, pin 1 positive, pin 2 GND.\nMatch cell/USB budget; bench-check Q6 charge current and off leakage."
